...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
app: app.py { class: ours }
runner: Runner { class: ours }
openai: OpenAI API { class: ext }

user -> app: 채팅 메시지
app -> runner: Runner.run_sync(agent, prompt)
runner -> runner: model 미지정 -> get_default_model()
runner -> openai: 클라이언트 생성 후 모델 호출
openai -> runner: 응답 텍스트
runner -> app: result.final_output
app -> user: 화면 표시
